00:16:01,460 --> 00:16:04,340
It was a special secret
between the two of us.

258
00:16:04,980 --> 00:16:07,039
Otoko is one of my closest friends.

259
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:12,220
Her smiling face has gotten
me through so many hard days.

260
00:16:12,560 --> 00:16:15,140
She reminds me of myself 20 years ago.

261
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:17,980
I was about her age on that day.

262
00:16:19,560 --> 00:16:21,880
The day my whole world fell apart.

263
00:16:22,620 --> 00:16:24,280
I'll never forget it.

264
00:16:29,300 --> 00:16:30,720
Leave to the future.

265
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:32,020
Live on.

266
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:36,820
Please, I made up my mind, too!

267
00:16:37,700 --> 00:16:39,220
Mother! Father!

268
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:41,280
No, I won't leave you!

269
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,972
At the time, I had no understanding
of what was occurring.

270
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:50,040
Suddenly, right before my eyes,

271
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:54,506
My beloved brother and the others
all vanished into the flames.

272
00:16:57,140 --> 00:17:01,820
Before I could even process the death
of my father, I lost my mother as well.

273
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:05,207
Everything was taken
from me in a single day.

274
00:17:05,740 --> 00:17:09,034
I was told that my brother
would return in twenty years.

275
00:17:09,440 --> 00:17:15,260
But after a tragedy so great, such an
immaterial hope offered me little solace.

276
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:19,260
I completely lost the will to go on.

277
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:24,777
Why didn't they have you jump
into the future with your brother?

278
00:17:24,860 --> 00:17:26,620
It was either him or me.

279
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,652
We couldn't let the Kozuki bloodline die.

280
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:33,629
If something happened to both
of us, then all would be lost.

281
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:34,880
So that's why.

282
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:36,580
That's messed up.

283
00:17:36,740 --> 00:17:38,916
I was never completely alone, though.

284
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,200
My father's ally,

285
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:45,620
a kindly retainer named Kawamatsu the
Kappa, raised me with patience and care.

286
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:47,320
A Kappa? Indeed.

287
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:50,857
Hard to believe that he's
one of those river creatures,

288
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:52,940
but he's not ashamed of that fact.

289
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:54,495
He takes pride in it.

290
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:59,520
The day that the castle burned
down, we were surrounded by enemies.

291
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:03,780
However, he helped me escape
through the moat undetected.

292
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,660
Princess, just a bit longer.

293
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:12,380
After losing my father, mother,

294
00:18:12,640 --> 00:18:16,780
and brother, the shock robbed
me of my ability to speak.

295
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:19,820
but he did his utmost best to cheer me up.

296
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,620
Princess, this is the cup-a-dance.

297
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:33,320
Surprise, I brought you food. Dig in.

298
00:18:38,020 --> 00:18:40,844
Your tummy is saying it's
hungry, too, isn't it?

299
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:44,760
No, I have a bit of an
upset stomach, you see.

300
00:18:45,280 --> 00:18:47,104
That's why it's being so noisy.

301
00:18:47,580 --> 00:18:48,580
That's a fib.

302
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:51,937
Can't you at least put
half of this with me?

303
00:18:52,020 --> 00:18:53,617
No, no, it's fine.

304
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:56,818
I found a grilled fish
swimming in the river earlier.

305
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:03,980
A grilled fish was in
the water? Yes, indeed.

306
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:07,380
I filleted and gobbled up
that tasty little fellow.

307
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:09,920
So don't you worry about me, all right?

308
00:19:11,260 --> 00:19:13,560
He would always make sure to feed me,

309
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:16,537
even if that meant there
was nothing left for him

310
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:20,137
I owe everything to him
His kindness allowed me

311
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:22,926
to smile once more If
it weren't for his help,

312
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:24,687
I'd have been lost to sorrow

313
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,260
So where is he now?

314
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:33,560
When I was about 13, we were separated
Since then, I haven't seen him

315
00:19:35,020 --> 00:19:37,200
However, he is a samurai

316
00:19:37,880 --> 00:19:40,056
Kawamatsu must be out there somewhere

317
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,280
I know it!

318
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:45,777
Certainly he's waiting for the day of
the great battle to make his return.

319
00:19:45,860 --> 00:19:48,980
How I wish to see him again,
as well as the others.

320
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:51,760
I've never met a real coppa before!

321
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:58,520
Sir Zorojuro? Hmm?

322
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:03,640
If I may ask you, who's here to
help prepare for the big uprising?

323
00:20:04,280 --> 00:20:05,560
There's a few of us.

324
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,620
What? What?

325
00:20:08,320 --> 00:20:11,940
So the doggie and the kitty
are with you as well? Yeah.

326
00:20:12,420 --> 00:20:14,817
But I had heard that they were both dead.

327
00:20:14,900 --> 00:20:17,429
I was certain I would
never see them again.

328
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:22,333
I don't think Cat Vipers arrived here
yet, but he's involved in the plans.

329
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:27,080
What's with that face?

330
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:29,500
I am just so happy.

331
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:46,077
I can't cry now I am a samurai's daughter

332
00:20:46,160 --> 00:20:49,197
considering that the
doggy and kitty made it

333
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:52,817
back all of the Akazaya
9 could reunite that

334
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:55,665
would be like a dream
well don't get your hopes

335
00:21:00,060 --> 00:21:02,000
There's Kin'emon,

336
00:21:02,340 --> 00:21:05,757
then Kanjuro, Raizo, Kiku,

337
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:09,660
Dogstorm, and Cat Viper.

338
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:18,000
Those are the six we have contact
with, plus Momonosuke, obviously.

339
00:21:18,520 --> 00:21:22,457
But I've never even met the other
three, so who knows where they are.

340
00:21:22,540 --> 00:21:25,658
One of them is Kawamatsu,
whom I just told you about.

341
00:21:26,320 --> 00:21:29,560
The last three are him,
Denjiro, and Ashura Doji.

342
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:32,617
While I certainly do not know
where they are currently,

343
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:34,820
I pray that they are alive and well.

344
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:40,460
But the entire flower capital is in
an uproar over this symbolic flyer.

345
00:21:40,780 --> 00:21:43,160
I am certain they know and will appear.

346
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:46,917
Those are the flyers we handed
out to the rebels earlier, right?

347
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:47,980
Yes, they are.

348
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,277
Thanks to all this commotion,

349
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:54,537
