Otoko, can you believe it?

362
00:22:35,100 --> 00:22:36,880
My brother is alive

363
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:41,000
Such good news This is great

364
00:22:42,320 --> 00:22:44,600
I'm so happy for you

365
00:22:46,020 --> 00:22:49,620
This is the best day ever It really is

366
