387
00:24:36,420 --> 00:24:38,477
We have nothing to do with any rebellion.

388
00:24:38,560 --> 00:24:39,390
Is that so?

389
00:24:39,473 --> 00:24:43,200
Well, then, I challenge you to
explain the meaning of this flyer.

390
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:45,660
The implication is quite clear.

391
00:24:46,080 --> 00:24:49,557
Why else would there be a reversed
crescent moon at the center?

392
00:24:49,640 --> 00:24:54,560
No matter how you look at it, it spells
out insurrection against Shogun Oroji.

393
00:24:54,820 --> 00:24:57,380
It undoubtedly resembles your tattoos.

394
00:24:58,020 --> 00:24:59,780
You've caused enough trouble.

395
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:02,260
Now accept your punishment.

396
00:25:14,420 --> 00:25:16,300
They're in some deep crap, huh?

397
00:25:16,600 --> 00:25:18,620
I hope nobody thinks we talked.

398
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:22,940
They know we would never
rat them out, don't they?

399
00:25:25,600 --> 00:25:27,100
Don't worry, you guys.

400
00:25:28,500 --> 00:25:31,324
No matter what, Captain
Law will have our backs.

401
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:49,560
