402
00:25:56,220 --> 00:25:58,920
I could go for a bit of sumo myself.

403
00:25:59,380 --> 00:26:00,980
The name's Medilloman.

404
00:26:01,780 --> 00:26:03,280
I'm a mess you up.

405
00:26:03,740 --> 00:26:05,440
I'm a gift or tell.

406
00:26:11,180 --> 00:26:12,010
Ah!

407
00:26:12,093 --> 00:26:13,486
