What the hell?

534
00:34:28,720 --> 00:34:29,657
It can't be!

535
00:34:29,740 --> 00:34:32,240
He's been Hyogoro the flower all along?

536
00:34:35,640 --> 00:34:37,480
Well, Mr. Straw Hat?

537
00:34:38,740 --> 00:34:41,400
Was that what you were attempting to do?

538
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:43,428
Something like that attack?

539
00:34:43,740 --> 00:34:46,900
If so, then maybe I
can help you after all.

540
00:34:52,260 --> 00:34:53,820
You really did it.

541
00:34:55,460 --> 00:34:57,140
Can you teach me?

